[
  {
    "page_index": 1,
    "id": "text_042800e75e4840b0",
    "source_text": "WHERE\nARE NAEUN\nAND AHMI?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 2,
    "id": "text_7c17bd50bb8349d1",
    "source_text": "I GOT\nDARK STAR TO\nLOOK AFTER THEM\nWHILE THEY WENT\nON AHEAD."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 2,
    "id": "text_c33d294250184f11",
    "source_text": "PRINCE AND HIS\nPARTY WILL BE GOING\nAFTER THEM."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 3,
    "id": "text_c8300de7a61849d1",
    "source_text": "BEFORE THAT...\nWE SHOULD TAKE\nCARE OF-"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 5,
    "id": "text_ce32cb2cd34b4d62",
    "source_text": "SO WHICH WAY\nSHOULD WE GO?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 5,
    "id": "text_6b7b453d28b74073",
    "source_text": "THEY LEFT THEIR\nCOMRADE BEHIND\nAND RAN AWAY?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 5,
    "id": "text_be1b011a2638412a",
    "source_text": "... THEY'RE FAST."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 6,
    "id": "text_f0e47518e5db4a55",
    "source_text": "I'LL GO ON\nAHEAD!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 6,
    "id": "text_6ce69d12e5094e03",
    "source_text": "THAT WAY.\nHURRY!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 13,
    "id": "text_a8462747ab594acb",
    "source_text": "GOTCHA!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 15,
    "id": "text_789a77a97f29484e",
    "source_text": "HOW ANNOYING...\nHOW MUCH LONGER\nARE YOU GOING TO\nUSE THESE FAKE\nPUPPETS?!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 15,
    "id": "text_ecff1a23010f4212",
    "source_text": "IT WAS\nFAKE?!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 16,
    "id": "text_81b42f527c0f460d",
    "source_text": "ARE YOU\nABLE TO TELL THE\nDIFFERENCE?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 18,
    "id": "text_1e8d6dbb3c244180",
    "source_text": "WE JUST\nNEED TO FIND THE\nPATH THAT HAS NO\nPUPPETS."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 18,
    "id": "text_06a6692664694818",
    "source_text": "THEN THE\nANSWER IS\nSIMPLE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 18,
    "id": "text_b6efb1216dad4934",
    "source_text": "ALL THE ONES\nIN FRONT OF US\nARE FAKE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 19,
    "id": "text_0e39e85f58004bfb",
    "source_text": "DAMN IT...!\nHE FIGURED IT OUT\nIN ONE GO?!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 20,
    "id": "text_187dd0a62f284bde",
    "source_text": "BUT WHAT\nSHOULD WE DO\nABOUT THIS? BLOOD...\nISN'T ANSWERING."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 21,
    "id": "text_dd515c5aa0864622",
    "source_text": "DON'T TELL\nME HE WENT OFF\nTO DO HIS OWN\nTHING AGAIN."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 21,
    "id": "text_0b1bbc4792c046e3",
    "source_text": "I WARNED HIM\nBEFOREHAND,\nTOO..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 21,
    "id": "text_20b7e09e6dba4c10",
    "source_text": "HE REALLY HAS\nNO PATIENCE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 23,
    "id": "text_a566dec6588a461b",
    "source_text": "IDIOTS...! I'M\nOVER HERE!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 24,
    "id": "text_d0da59b747e24694",
    "source_text": "...PLEASE FALL\nFOR IT!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 25,
    "id": "text_389e2619ec654613",
    "source_text": "TURN YOUR\nATTENTION\nTO ME!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 30,
    "id": "text_c88b723f50c94421",
    "source_text": "DARK STAR...\nWILL BE OKAY,\nRIGHT?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 31,
    "id": "text_db05c240392f4332",
    "source_text": "Meow-"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 31,
    "id": "text_3686fc49acd34585",
    "source_text": "SHH...!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 32,
    "id": "text_cce8c22206f9466c",
    "source_text": "EEK...!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 32,
    "id": "text_073ec27707a24ffd",
    "source_text": "...EXCUSE ME."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 33,
    "id": "text_b6bcd4d548774a6e",
    "source_text": "WHY ARE YOU\nSO SCARED?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 33,
    "id": "text_b8a7b82af35c4250",
    "source_text": "DID SOMETHING\nHAPPEN?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 34,
    "id": "text_5ecc46b5cb87466c",
    "source_text": "WE'RE JUST...\nTAKING A SHORT\nBREAK BECAUSE MY\nLEGS HURT."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 34,
    "id": "text_158262c351b847d6",
    "source_text": "N-NO!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 35,
    "id": "text_254b347f3f804a4e",
    "source_text": "AHA... I JUST\nASKED BECAUSE\nIT'S SO CHAOTIC\nOUT THERE,"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 36,
    "id": "text_866627ff329a4c3d",
    "source_text": "AND I THOUGHT...\nYOU WERE BEING CHASED\nBY SOMEONE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 39,
    "id": "text_e42cac85c0bb4526",
    "source_text": "AHMI...\nLET'S GO."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 39,
    "id": "text_8dfa6bf826734031",
    "source_text": "...?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 40,
    "id": "text_00b5bbac7b9344d3",
    "source_text": "LEAVING\nALREADY?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 42,
    "id": "text_eb0b92d2133f4561",
    "source_text": "SO I'LL BE\nUPSET IF WE GO\nOUR SEPARATE\nWAYS NOW."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 42,
    "id": "text_2df2bb7988284c34",
    "source_text": "I FOLLOWED\nYOUR SCENT ALL THE\nWAY HERE..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 43,
    "id": "text_ca3b8d0c5bf64bf2",
    "source_text": "IT CAN'T BE!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 44,
    "id": "text_6c1c513255864ed6",
    "source_text": "HELLO,\nLADIES."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 45,
    "id": "text_163d6592bc67481d",
    "source_text": "HIDE AND\nSEEK IS OVER\nNOW."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 47,
    "id": "text_54edd5c03e314edd",
    "source_text": "RUN,\nAHMI!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 48,
    "id": "text_acbac4d97d224085",
    "source_text": "THAT'S\nNOT FUN!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 50,
    "id": "text_398b10b7be5d47e9",
    "source_text": "...?!!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 51,
    "id": "text_940955579f314c23",
    "source_text": "AAAH!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 57,
    "id": "text_5167533b34534937",
    "source_text": "YOU'RE\nSO CUTE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 58,
    "id": "text_1bd7e2e3c7154d12",
    "source_text": "...HEY. LET'S\nLET IT GO."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 58,
    "id": "text_334e6d5d7c344547",
    "source_text": "YOUR NAME\nWILL BE MIMI."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 59,
    "id": "text_fb1958891b7b43b0",
    "source_text": "THE OUTSIDE\nIS BETTER..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 59,
    "id": "text_323f035df9b7427e",
    "source_text": "COMPARED TO\nBEING TRAPPED\nIN HERE, LIKE\nWE ARE."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 60,
    "id": "text_6a97da96e6714d87",
    "source_text": "N-NO!\nI'M GOING TO\nKEEP IT!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 60,
    "id": "text_f6ca5b577efc407f",
    "source_text": "STOP BEING\nWHINY."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 61,
    "id": "text_27b2c10883c44d75",
    "source_text": "JUST A LITTLE\nMORE... ONCE IT\nGETS A LITTLE\nBIGGER..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 61,
    "id": "text_363e1d62ddfc4ad4",
    "source_text": "BUT IT'S\nTOO YOUNG."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 63,
    "id": "text_ca2c93a90de24859",
    "source_text": "NO...!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 64,
    "id": "text_9f3aafe612df43f7",
    "source_text": "NO...!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 65,
    "id": "text_a95aef7cedaa4d3c",
    "source_text": "PLEASE! GIVE\nIT BACK!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 66,
    "id": "text_ef58d15244b14460",
    "source_text": "IT'LL DIE\nIF IT'S LEFT\nALONE!"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 72,
    "id": "text_6129bc0d428148ce",
    "source_text": "SHAMELESS..."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 73,
    "id": "text_1aea0230c3964f30",
    "source_text": "YOU'RE GOING\nTO TAKE IT FROM\nME AGAIN?"
  },
  {
    "page_index": 74,
    "id": "text_1d5d4db5b84c468b",
    "source_text": "I'M SICK\nAND TIRED\nOF THIS."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 75,
    "id": "text_d69d4204fc8b4a36",
    "source_text": "I'LL KILL\nYOU ALL... AND\nBLOOM THE BLOOD\nFLOWERS."
  },
  {
    "page_index": 76,
    "id": "text_2f380f5adb9b47f3",
    "source_text": "FOR I AM RED\nDEATH PEONY."
  }
]